DESCRIPTION:Project: City Planning & Development Review Community Consulta
 tion Meetings\n\nJoin us for a Community Consultation Meeting to learn mor
 e about the application at 680 - 688 Sheppard Avenue East\, ask questions 
 of the City and the Applicant\, and share your comments. An Official Plan 
 Amendment and Zoning By-law Amendment application has been submitted to pe
 rmit the development of two towers at 37 and 28 storeys on a shared six-st
 orey podium with a total of 789 residential units\, inclusive of 47 rental
  replacement units. A total of approximately 70 square metres of retail sp
 ace is proposed. An on-site parkland dedication is proposed with an area o
 f 759 square metres and a walkway proposed as a POPS with an area of 1\,00
 0 square metres. The development proposes 288 vehicle parking spaces\, inc
 luding 0 visitor spaces. A total of 608 bicycle parking spaces are propose
 d. The building will be a phased development with the 28-storey tower prop
 osed as Phase I and the 37-storey tower as Phase II.\n\nRegistration: http
 s://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/ce5abc38-0599-4cbc-8f92-a0e950d9450b@
 f0bc8ec6-9ed8-4d0c-9189-411ad949cc65
